WEBVTT

00:13:28.662 --> 00:13:31.287
they turn it off in the winter,
ice in the pipes.

00:13:31.287 --> 00:13:35.037
But in the summer, it is a sight
to see. I want to be here to see it.

00:13:35.037 --> 00:13:36.412
I plan to be.

00:13:37.246 --> 00:13:38.746
I hope to be.

00:13:40.246 --> 00:13:42.329
This disease will be
the end of many of us,

00:13:42.371 --> 00:13:43.537
but not nearly all,

00:13:43.579 --> 00:13:47.246
and the dead will be commemorated,
and they will struggle on with the living,

00:13:47.287 --> 00:13:49.162
and we are not going away.

00:13:49.204 --> 00:13:51.121
We won't die secret deaths anymore.

00:13:51.162 --> 00:13:53.621
The world only spins forward.

00:13:53.621 --> 00:13:54.871
We will be citizens.

00:13:54.871 --> 00:13:57.496
The time has come. Bye, now.

00:13:57.912 --> 00:14:00.287
You are fabulous creatures,
each and every one.